s/8540)) ([a18b1d9](https://redirect.github.com/authelia/authelia/commit/a18b1d9cee0469137ce0d2d3cb40706f43c7d145)), closes [#&#8203;8537](https://redirect.github.com/authelia/authelia/issues/8537)\n-   **web:** missing translations ([#&#8203;8318](https://redirect.github.com/authelia/authelia/issues/8318)) ([db901a0](https://redirect.github.com/authelia/authelia/commit/db901a01a87c8b91e9c539dbd61e8df00a9bc06e))\n-   **web:** undesirable default method ux ([#&#8203;8521](https://redirect.github.com/authelia/authelia/issues/8521)) ([7f515d1](https://redirect.github.com/authelia/authelia/commit/7f515d188c01f3885b78e1e3eba29af9602661e7)), closes [#&#8203;8345](https://redirect.github.com/authelia/authelia/issues/8345)\n\n##### Docker Container\n\n-   `docker pull authelia/authelia:4.38.18`\n-   `docker pull ghcr.io/authelia/authelia:4.38.18`\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: Branch creation - At any time (no schedule defined), Automerge - At any time (no schedule defined).\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you are satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://redirect.github.com/renovatebot/renovate).\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiIzOS44Ni40IiwidXBkYXRlZEluVmVyIjoiMzkuODYuNCIsInRhcmdldEJyYW5jaCI6Im1haW4iLCJsYWJlbHMiOlsicmVub3ZhdGUvY29udGFpbmVyIiwidHlwZS9wYXRjaCJdfQ==-->\n",
